<title>USA: Buckle president Nelson adds CEO post.</title>
<headline>Buckle president Nelson adds CEO post.</headline>
<dateline>KEARNEY, Neb. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buckle Inc said Thursday it had named Dennis Nelson, its president, to the additional post of chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Daniel Hirschfeld, who is relinquishing his position as CEO, will remain chairman.</p>
